00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:14.976
I'm Niels Provos.

00:00:14.976 --> 00:00:16.600
I'm a distinguished
Engineer at Google.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:18.890
I've been there
for about 13 years.

00:00:18.890 --> 00:00:22.310
These days, I manage the
security and engineering--

00:00:22.310 --> 00:00:24.850
security and privacy
engineering teams.

00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:27.300
Today I want to
talk to you about

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:32.060
