00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:48.560
Either as a user of
our consumer offerings

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:54.260
or as an enterprise
customer of GCP or G Suite.

00:00:54.260 --> 00:00:58.580
And I'm here today to give
